 ],
 "notes": "The MRAP policy document is unknown at plan (it embeds the access point alias), so its actions are checked on the declared configuration or a referenced policy-document data source. Bucket/control-plane regions are not checked: the planned values of this provider version carry no region attribute and provider aliases are not visible in the normalised input (schema limitation). The 'only the owning account' principal is a computed account ID and is not checked. IAM permission checks also read the declared policy text because policies that embed bucket/key ARNs are unknown at plan."
}